Apply: oc apply -f ui\ui-eventlistener-route.yaml
Expected: route.route.openshift.io/ui-eventlistener created

oc get route ui-eventlistener
NAME               HOST/PORT                                                               PATH   SERVICES              PORT   TERMINATION   WILDCARD
