Step 9 - EventListener Created a PipelineRun
After sending the POST request, we checked:

oc get pipelinerun
NAME                         SUCCEEDED   REASON      STARTTIME   COMPLETIONTIME
ui-pipeline-run-cwxvd        Unknown     Running     31s

This was important because we did not manually create this PipelineRun.
The EventListener/Trigger created it automatically.

Step 10 - Add webhook to GitHub Repository
We went to our GitHub repository, then Settings → Webhooks → Add webhook.
Payload URL: https://ui-eventlistener-amirahmad2204-dev.apps.rm3.7wse.p1.openshiftapps.com
Content type: application/json
Secret: (we left it empty)
Events: Just the push event.
Active: Mark as Active
Then we clicked "Add webhook".


